  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDLO Access to Justice - Inception Phase 2017</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IDLO Access to Justice - Inception Phase 2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TEST 2</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ambassaden avser att under sex m&#xe5;nader 2017 st&#xf6;dja IDLO:s uppstartsfas av programmet &quot;Access to Justice&quot;. Det initiala st&#xf6;det till IDLO under uppstartsfasen kommer att m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra: 

&#x2022; att IDLO utvecklar ett slutligt programdokument
&#x2022; etablering av IDLO-kontor/n&#xe4;rvaro i landet samt
&#x2022; planering och f&#xf6;rberedelser f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;rande av ett l&#xe5;ngsiktigt &quot;Access to Justice&quot;-program

Uppstartsfasen kommer att inkludera f&#xf6;ljande aspekter/element; inr&#xe4;ttande av organisation, budgetering, st&#xe4;rkt partnerskapsbyggande, framtagande av en l&#xe4;mplig f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringsteori samt av ett programdokument f&#xf6;r l&#xe5;ngsiktigt st&#xf6;d som innefattar tillg&#xe5;ng till r&#xe4;ttvisa, inklusive r&#xe4;ttslig pr&#xf6;vning och r&#xe4;ttss&#xe4;kerhet.

Den totala budgeten f&#xf6;r uppstartfasen &#xe4;r 3 160 000 SEK. Uppstartfasen planeras p&#xe5;g&#xe5; under sex m&#xe5;nader fr&#xe5;n det att avtal skrivs under.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the Programme is to enhance access to justice for the most vulnerable and marginalised people living in rural areas, where accessibility of quality, affordable, fair justice services, or provision of legal assistance, remains challenging. The Programme seeks to legally-empower grassroots communities (with a specific focus on women, children and the marginalised), and enhance the capacity of duty bearers at the community level to provide the most vulnerable and disadvantaged citizens with quality legal knowledge and skills building to uphold their basic rights, challenge their grievances in an equitable manner, and obtain gender-sensitived justice remedy, and reparation or compensation.

The Inception phase will provide information and basis for supporting access to justice and rule of law that addresses challenges faced by the most vulnerable groups in Ugandan. It will provide IDLO with information on how best to design the programme that responds to the needs of the people.</narrative>
  </description>
